            "id": "part-1-group-1",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 1–10</h3><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p>Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "maxWords": 2,
            "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"summary\"><div class=\"summary-title\">Employment Agency: Possible Jobs</div>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">First Job</p>\n<p>Administrative assistant in a company that produces {{1}} (North London)</p>\n<p>Responsibilities</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>data entry</li>\n<li>go to {{2}} and take notes</li>\n<li>general admin</li>\n<li>management of {{3}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Requirements</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>good computer skills including spreadsheets</li>\n<li>good interpersonal skills</li>\n<li>attention to {{4}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>need a minimum of {{5}} of experience of teleconferencing</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">Second Job</p>\n<p>Warehouse assistant in South London</p>\n<p>Responsibilities</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>stock management</li>\n<li>managing {{6}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Requirements</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>ability to work with numbers</li>\n<li>good computer skills</li>\n<li>very organised and {{7}}</li>\n<li>good communication skills</li>\n<li>used to working in a {{8}}</li>\n<li>able to cope with items that are {{9}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Need experience of</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>driving in London</li>\n<li>warehouse work</li>\n<li>{{10}} service</li>\n</ul></div>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "instructionsHtml": "Part 2<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 11–16</h3><p>Choose the correct letter, <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong> or <strong>C</strong>.</p><p><strong>Street Play Scheme</strong></p>",
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "When did the Street Play Scheme first take place?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "two years ago"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "three years ago"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "six years ago"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "How often is Beechwood Road closed to traffic now?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "once a week"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "on Saturdays and Sundays"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "once a month"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "Who is responsible for closing the road?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "a council official"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "the police"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "local wardens"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "Residents who want to use their cars",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "have to park in another street."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "must drive very slowly."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "need permission from a warden."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 15,
                "textHtml": "Alice says that Street Play Schemes are most needed in",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "wealthy areas."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "quiet suburban areas."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "areas with heavy traffic."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 16,
                "textHtml": "What has been the reaction of residents who are not parents?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "Many of them were unhappy at first."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "They like seeing children play in the street."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "They are surprised by the lack of noise."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
